//RS //!
//RS //! Covers:
//RS //!   * `jet env` (`jetpack env`) never runs a project function (regression);
//RS //!   * project-level `jet dev` (bare, no file — distinct from the shipped
//RS //!     `jet dev <file.jet>` watch loop) runs `fn dev()` after the U12 no-op
//RS //!     service wait;
//RS //!   * `jet dev` with neither `fn dev()` nor `fn run()` is E1254;
//RS //!   * a trust-sensitive env hitting a non-interactive path with no grant is
//RS //!     a clean E1255, never a hang;
//RS //!   * `--trust` bypasses; `jetpack config trust add` pre-authorizes.
